# pouch-hello-fopen was retained as the regression that holds that claim
# honest -- and on the first post-merge boot it falsified half of it: the
# dropped patch ALSO carried an O_APPEND seek-to-END that main's 0024 does
# not, so fopen("a") wrote at offset 0 and clobbered the file. That one arm
# is ported back as 0030 below. task #50 is closed by 0023 + 0024 + 0030.
0028-pouch-net-nonblock.patch
